    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0010",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "The following example shows an ISO 8601 format with, and without, a time and fractional seconds.",
      "normalizedSource": "The following example shows an ISO 8601 format with, and without, a time and fractional seconds.",
      "sourceHash": "f621b86da677d1af61feff46d4022382408018a2a783cdd4f607e1cf0d40dd44",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "```swift\nlet meetingDate = Date() // Jun 24, 2021 at 6:52 AM\nmeetingDate.formatted(.iso8601\n    .year()\n    .month()\n    .day()\n    .time(includingFractionalSeconds: false)\n)\n// 20210624T115209\n\nmeetingDate.formatted(.iso8601\n    .year()\n    .time(includingFractionalSeconds: true)\n)\n// 2021T115209.274\n\nmeetingDate.formatted(.iso8601\n    .year()\n    .year()\n    .month()\n    .day()\n    .dateSeparator(.dash)\n    .time(includingFractionalSeconds: true)\n    .timeSeparator(.colon)\n)\n// 2021-06-24T11:52:09.274\n\nmeetingDate.formatted(.iso8601\n    .year()\n    .year()\n    .month()\n    .day()\n    .dateSeparator(.dash)\n    .time(includingFractionalSeconds: false)\n    .timeSeparator(.colon)\n    .dateTimeSeparator(.space)\n)\n// 2021-06-24 11:52:09\n```",
      "documentTitle": "time(includingFractionalSeconds:)",
      "framework": "Foundation",
      "ko": "",
      "status": "failed",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false
    },
